{"title":"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_12\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 12</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_12\">Problem 12</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 12\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> are positive numbers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/f/97f12a5a4a11c42a429ba7d3041bba87b515346c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q&lt;100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" />, then the number obtained by increasing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/f/03f019000e7e4e14a3379d05327eb7db704d2897.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" /> and decreasing the result by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/e/70e555d36c15eb480cfa4f879bfe491836075ef8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"23\" height=\"17\" /> exceeds <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> if and only if\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/6/706983548a161d78dde565350aed3fb86634b1a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ p&gt;q \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ p&gt;\\dfrac{q}{100-q}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ p&gt;\\dfrac{q}{1-q}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ p&gt;\\dfrac{100q}{100+q}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ p&gt;\\dfrac{100q}{100-q}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"712\" height=\"42\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The goal is to find when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/b/f9bf6bfd29d1a7b76128f8cc0980717709265f5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M\\left(1+\\frac{p}{100}\\right)\\left(1-\\frac{q}{100}\\right) &gt; M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"239\" height=\"35\" />.  Isolate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> as follows:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/8/8484e79836f2d01059736068e374365a3584572e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(1+\\frac{p}{100}\\right)\\left(1-\\frac{q}{100}\\right) &gt; 1\\]\" width=\"200\" height=\"33\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/a/01a87b5870645f18992761fa5a00f9c180750b5c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(\\frac{100+p}{100}\\right)\\left(\\frac{100-q}{100}\\right) &gt; 1\\]\" width=\"209\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36ceaa99131dfa675138d29df6bf134fac3bc504.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{(100+p)(100-q)}{10000} &gt; 1\\]\" width=\"179\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/1/ac189bf912ead55468753b101253ccf963c0ecc6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[100+p &gt; \\frac{10000}{100-q}\\]\" width=\"141\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/3/433fc9ec87d3c64472ac41ce0f9517e204efad17.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[p &gt; \\frac{10000}{100-q} - 100 = \\boxed{(\\textbf{E})\\ \\frac{100q}{100-q}}\\]\" width=\"276\" height=\"52\" />\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Choice A is incorrect. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/0/7f0403806e4dadc179c2a2dcc3650ddeea39ac22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(M, p, q) = (100, 50, 40)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"187\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b6051ac0a556f98f7481e62093ba35754d8805.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p &gt; q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> will not increase, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/9/a79e9316f0a31493c9392445a721bbf0f3948975.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 \\cdot 1.5 \\cdot 0.6 = 90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"144\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Choice B is incorrect. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/3/e632930e96ae58f098efb9984f9d1f22798b12a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(M, p, q) = (100, 50, 50)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"187\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/b/ccbeb301fbd806a342ca6a2864e98ddbac741786.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p &gt; \\frac{q}{100-q}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"97\" height=\"38\" />, but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> will not increase, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/2/f12d268436e77d3b82cefaec401f81075b1f4f7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 \\cdot 1.5 \\cdot 0.5 = 75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"144\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Choice C is incorrect. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/3/e632930e96ae58f098efb9984f9d1f22798b12a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(M, p, q) = (100, 50, 50)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"187\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/c/f0cd83ebf4514ba0397dde7669c966cb65197974.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p &gt; \\frac{q}{1-q}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"79\" height=\"38\" />, but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> will not increase, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/2/f12d268436e77d3b82cefaec401f81075b1f4f7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 \\cdot 1.5 \\cdot 0.5 = 75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"144\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>Choice D is incorrect. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b26686a0e70d0c3b4cc75638bfed05d283ffc9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(M, p, q) = (100, 100, 60)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"196\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/c/89c4793654bb1224bedef97a0e7f796b49160490.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p &gt; \\frac{100q}{100+q}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"97\" height=\"42\" />, but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> will not increase, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/8/3d8ece83ccf00be54753e95469c298e08580590a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 0.4 = 80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"130\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>By process of elimination, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/f/a0fc1f6c2b14600e68841c9c1fba4ff527f7f6a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(\\textbf{E})\\ \\dfrac{100q}{100-q}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"108\" height=\"53\" /> must be correct.\n</p><p>-Arcticturn, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME\" title=\"1981 AHSME\">1981 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1981 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1981\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" t